WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.387
This query counts the rows produced by the group by approach and the window approach.

00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:08.642
The grouped result has one row per patient.

00:00:08.642 --> 00:00:11.792
The window result has one row per admission.

00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:17.895
Neither is automatically better. They answer different analytical output-grain questions.
